NOTICE
======

This repository benchmarks its own mule-account detection model against three
third-party projects. Those projects are the work of their own authors and are
not part of this project. This file records who they are and how they are used.

Nothing from any third-party project is vendored, copied or redistributed here.
The benchmark harness reads each project in place, runs it through its own
public entrypoints, and reports the results. What travels with this repository
is our description of each system (bench/MODELS.md), our adapters, and the
numbers they produced.


